{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"more_loop\": \"X\",\n  \"x_loops\": [\n    \"S02→S04→S07：反复在“舍不得从前的亲近和自在”与“回去可能又要忍让、受委屈”之间摆。S02已经提醒自己不能忘记受过的气，S04又加入怕回去忍让，S07再次回到想找回亲近却不愿重受委屈的两难，核心冲突重复出现。\",\n    \"S03→S06→S10：反复经历想起从前亲近时心里发暖、随后又酸楚的情绪。S06增加了独自面对难事的现实体验，S10也进一步明确了自己最舍不得的是被当作自己人的感觉，但“暖又酸”的情绪反应仍有重复。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_loops\": [\n    \"S04→S07：两段都在反问当初离开是否正确、如果没有离开会怎样。S07增加了离开后实际经历的孤单，因此不只是重复，而是用新的体验重新审视过去的决定。\",\n    \"S10→S11：S10怀疑即使回去也未必能恢复从前的亲近，S11又冒出“万一能呢”的希望。不过S11接着明确不愿仅凭希望回去，并提出先把眼下日子过稳，回摆之后有了新的决定。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"X在S04重新带回S02已经出现的受委屈顾虑，S10又重复了此前暖意转酸楚的情绪落点。Y虽然也有回看和犹豫，但更多是在加入新的孤单体验、辨认回去的可能性之后，逐步形成不急着回头、先过好眼下的决定。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "478203f3-c052-4348-a8ab-13bec5081c83", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T103140004235Z", "elapsed_seconds": 71.282, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T10:32:51.295652+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3a188c5551d7444e0aefd4ea76fd51c6a5a46e0d75cfa8c225000e866c8d35a0", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6b